data/demo/demo_labels.csv) and derived trained ML artifacts
(artifacts/preprocessing/v2_flow_preprocessor.joblib and the 4 model artifacts
under artifacts/models/) are trained/sampled exclusively from:

  1. AIT NetFlow Data Set v2 (AIT-NDS-v2)
     Publisher: AIT Austrian Institute of Technology GmbH
     DOI      : 10.5281/zenodo.13168643
