                https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Additional datasets verified and supported in NetFlow Sentinel v2 external
benchmarks and correlation pipelines:

  2. CTU-SME-11
     Publisher: Stratosphere Laboratory, Czech Technical University in Prague
     DOI      : 10.5281/zenodo.7958258 (record 7958259)
